Third-party code
----------------

The Electron wrapper in src/ is this project's own code, but it is distributed
together with the game-base submodule, whose mods, desktop layout rules and
client-bundle patches are derived from Lindo
(https://github.com/zenoxs/lindo and https://github.com/zenoxs/lindo-game-base),
GPL-3.0. See game-base/NOTICE for the file-by-file list. That license is why
this repository is GPL-3.0 as well.

Dofus Touch is the property of Ankama. This project ships none of Ankama's
code: the client bundle is downloaded from Ankama's own servers at runtime and
patched locally on the user's machine. It is not affiliated with or endorsed by
Ankama.
